  #line-at(313.27pt, 194.42pt, "More recently, thin-channel MOSFETs with optimized T-")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 205.94pt, "gates and surface passivation achieved remarkable fₘₐₓ values ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 217.46pt, "(~48 GHz) while maintaining high breakdown voltages (~192 ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 228.98pt, "V) [8]. Furthermore, integration of β-Ga₂O₃ onto SiC ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 240.53pt, "substrates have   enabled unprecedented output power (2.3 ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 251.93pt, "W/mm at 2 GHz) and pushed fₘₐₓ up to 57 GHz [9].  ")
