  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(313.27pt, 190.7pt, "In conclusion, we have demonstrated MOCVD-grown β-")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 202.22pt, "Ga₂O₃ Si delta-doped FinFETs, modulating a record high ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 213.74pt, "channel charge density of 3.3×10¹³ cm⁻² along with a high ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 225.26pt, "on/off ratio of ~10")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.48pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(389.11pt, 221.78pt, "8")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(392.35pt, 225.26pt, "-10⁹. Using a 100 nm fin width and a high ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 236.78pt, "charge density Si delta-doped channel, the devices exhibit ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 248.33pt, "record high performance including drain current density of ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 259.73pt, "410 mA/mm, transconductance of 60 mS/mm, breakdown ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 271.25pt, "voltage exceeding 200V and current gain cut off frequency of ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 282.77pt, "3.8 GHz. The DC and RF performance of these FinFETs can ")
  #line-at(313.27pt, 294.29pt, "be further enhanced by scaling the gate length.   ")
